    pr_ref:  # 2f2c
    description: "User-gated decision: should the verb migrate too? Arguments for: noun-verb consistency (`hypergumbo survey <repo>` produces `survey.json`); reads naturally in docs. Arguments against: breaking change for existing users with scripts using `hypergumbo run`; the verb is widely typed at command lines; backward-compat layer would be needed similar to S3 but for the verb. If the decision is yes: add `hypergumbo survey` as a primary verb and keep `hypergumbo run` as a deprecated alias for one minor version. Decision belongs in the ADR (S1)."  # 2f2c
    fields: {}  # 2f2c
