  message: "2026-06-10 design-interview ruling (ADR-0042, merged in PR #4181): the verb decision is YES — hypergumbo survey becomes the primary verb, with hypergumbo run kept as a deprecated alias for one minor version. The decision is recorded in the ADR, which was this item's entire scope; the verb implementation itself tracks under the rename implementation work. Suggest closing as done once the ADR PR merges."  # c334
